Files in this directory are unmodified copies of the upstream sources, kept
here so the agentic mining loop can reference them locally without an
internet round-trip.

Original upstream license: MIT — see LICENSE-MIT in this directory.

Files vendored:
- mutation_engine.py        — directed mutation engine (port → mutation.py)
- expression_parser.py      — recursive-descent operator parser (validation
                              subset → expr_parser.py)
- crossover_engine.py       — top-segment recombination (port → crossover.py)
- anti_overfit.py           — 4-layer anti-overfitting tests (Day 4 port)
- wq_simulate.py            — local WQ-aligned dollar-neutral simulation (Day 4 port)
- mcp_server.py             — MCP tool definitions (score_factor formula port → scoring.py)
- rolling_validator.py      — walk-forward validation (Day 4 — folded into anti_overfit)
- FACTOR_MINING.md          — 6-phase research methodology (used to rewrite agent_brief.md)

Modifications: none in this directory. The ports under
src/agent_market/wq_brain/{mutation,expr_parser,crossover,scoring}.py adapt
the logic for our WQ FASTEXPR operator subset and English-first prompts; see
those files' docstrings for adaptation notes.
